{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023250/extras/ff2522d018a0b954daf0478749894903.avif?t=1758398929\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of tiny, virtual protozoa. Take control of one in free play to just explore or attempt to outlast another on a variety of custom boards. The controls are simple, but in the spirit of experimentation you'll have to figure them out on your own by playing. Don't worry, though: if your protozoa doesn't make it, you can always relax and keep watching to see what the other virtual protozoa get up to...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023250/extras/ba4e8520c1bfe0705dd54748e4726e3e.avif?t=1758398929\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've figured out how to control each proto-type (ha!), the Challenges mode lets you pick a type to try and outlast. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023250/extras/6ae41373bf1c9f3c12ba8bb48e762a45.avif?t=1758398929\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each challenge board is customized for the specific face-off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, grab your mouse, keyboard, and/or controller and GO!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4023250?t=1758398929","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023250/41074b21b4aadc93f6fbda9b07e62d6e510b7301/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758398929","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023250/21589c2b04bab75aad66ff95f5e3a4d31478955a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758398929","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023250/21589c2b04bab75aad66ff95f5e3a4d31478955a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758398929","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023250/extras/ff2522d018a0b954daf0478749894903.avif?t=1758398929\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of tiny, virtual protozoa. Take control of one in free play to just explore or attempt to outlast another on a variety of custom boards. The controls are simple, but in the spirit of experimentation you'll have to figure them out on your own by playing. Don't worry, though: if your protozoa doesn't make it, you can always relax and keep watching to see what the other virtual protozoa get up to...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023250/extras/ba4e8520c1bfe0705dd54748e4726e3e.avif?t=1758398929\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've figured out how to control each proto-type (ha!), the Challenges mode lets you pick a type to try and outlast. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023250/extras/6ae41373bf1c9f3c12ba8bb48e762a45.avif?t=1758398929\" width=1560 heig